 "releases": [
  {
   "id": "freddy-spaghetti-132369@post-2020-04-06",
   "gameId": "freddy-spaghetti-132369",
   "displayName": "Minor Fixes and Changes",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2020-04-06T20:38:14.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Well hello there my fellow gamers!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "I've been noticing, from watching Youtube gameplay, that there are some issues regarding the game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Minor bugs and things like text being too bright etc. You might have been noticing tiny updates recently, that were sent out specifically to fix these issues.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "In addition to this, I've also noticed some frustration regarding certain levels. Look, a joke is a joke, but I feel bad about the torment that some of you had to go through.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "So, I've also made some levels a bit easier. The levels in question are 5-5 and 5-9.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "If you found yourself putting the game aside because of these, I invite you to give it another go! :)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Freddy's story needs to be heard, in FULL...",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "That's it for now, but I'm still scouring the interwebs in an effort to provide the best possible experience for you wonderful folks!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Kind Regards,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Dr Pasta",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
